{"id": "Ugw13xE3ykbbiyYXecJ4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "쥑인다 \n이은하 노래", "published": "2026-06-24T02:07:36", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxcnSdfUiDIlFixh0Z4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "건강하세요 응원합니다 화이팅입니다 건강하세요 멋져요", "published": "2026-06-14T17:14:19", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
